WEBVTT

00:22:29.579 --> 00:22:31.288
as well when you've said, look, you know,

00:22:31.288 --> 00:22:34.038
you can trust your intuition if you're
in a predictable environment,

00:22:34.204 --> 00:22:37.246
you have regular practice and you get
immediate feedback on your judgment.

00:22:38.288 --> 00:22:40.538
I think the tension for me here is

00:22:40.871 --> 00:22:44.329
I don't know how capable people are
of delaying their intuition.

00:22:44.746 --> 00:22:48.329
And I wonder if if what might be
more practical is to say, OK,

00:22:48.538 --> 00:22:51.829
let's make your intuition explicit
instead of implicit early on

00:22:52.079 --> 00:22:54.163
so that then you can rigorously
challenge it

00:22:54.163 --> 00:22:56.246
and figure out if it's valid
in this situation.

00:22:57.079 --> 00:23:01.788
I've been deeply influenced by something
that I did very early in my career.